<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>VectorLume – Lizenzen der Bibliotheken</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; --bg: #ffffff; --fg: #1b1f24; --muted: #5b6270; --code: #f3f4f6; --link: #2563eb; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { :root { --bg: #16181d; --fg: #e4e6eb; --muted: #9aa1ad; --code: #22252c; --link: #7aa7ff; } }
  body { font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 16px; line-height: 1.5; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: .25rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 2rem 0 .25rem; }
  p.note { color: var(--muted); }
  a { color: var(--link); }
  ul { padding-left: 1.25rem; }
  ul.used-by { columns: 2; font-size: .9rem; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; background: var(--code); padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: .8rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>VectorLume – Lizenzen der verwendeten Bibliotheken</h1>
<p class="note">Third-party licenses. VectorLume uses the following open-source libraries; their license texts are reproduced below.</p>
<p class="note">This software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group.</p>
<p class="note">Alle Bibliotheken werden unverändert verwendet; ihr Quelltext ist unter den verlinkten Seiten auf
crates.io erhältlich (für MPL-2.0-Bibliotheken wie serialport ausdrücklich verlangt). / All libraries are used
unmodified; their source code is available from the linked crates.io pages (as required for MPL-2.0 libraries such as
serialport).</p>
<p class="note">LightBurn is a trademark of LightBurn Software, LLC. VectorLume is not affiliated with LightBurn
Software; it only reads the .lbrn2 file format.</p>

<h2>Hershey-Schriften / Hershey Fonts</h2>
<p>The single-line fonts (Hershey Sans, Serif, Script, Cursive, Gothic) use font data distributed under the following terms:</p>
<pre>This distribution of the Hershey Fonts may be used by anyone for any purpose, commercial or otherwise, providing that:
1. The following acknowledgements must be distributed with the font data:
   - The Hershey Fonts were originally created by Dr. A. V. Hershey while working at the U. S. National Bureau of Standards.
   - The format of the Font data in this distribution was originally created by
     James Hurt, Cognition, Inc., 900 Technology Park Drive, Billerica, MA 01821 (mit-eddie!ci-dandelion!hurt)
2. The font data in this distribution may be converted into any other format *EXCEPT* the format distributed by
   the U.S. NTIS (which organization holds the rights to the distribution and use of the font data in that particular format).</pre>

<h2>Übersicht / Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

<h2>Lizenztexte / License texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
<ul class="used-by">
{{#each used_by}}
  <li><a href="https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}/{{crate.version}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
